{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חָכְמָה","hw":"חָכְמָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. wisdom</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">Dn 2:30</a> +, emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמְתָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:20\" href=\"/Daniel.2.20\">Dn 2:20</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:25\" href=\"/Ezra.7.25\">Ezr 7:25</a>;—<em>wisdom</em>, attrib. of God <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:20\" href=\"/Daniel.2.20\">Dn 2:20</a>; of gods <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a>; of man <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">2:30</a>; of God imparted to man <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:25\" href=\"/Ezra.7.25\">Ezr 7:25</a> (practical wisdom), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:21\" href=\"/Daniel.2.21\">Dn 2:21</a>; = occult knowledge (v. foregoing) imparted to men v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:23\" href=\"/Daniel.2.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:14\" href=\"/Daniel.5.14\">14</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֵ֫לֶם","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חַכִּים"}